    "body": "> IMO this will be more confusing because there will be a new cpu memory utilisation flag on GPU installs.\r\n> \r\n> I would sooner accept `--device-memory-utilization` as an alias. But I would prefer to add it to `CacheConfig` as a property that maps to `self.gpu_memory_utilization` so Python API users can use it too.\r\n\r\nthanks for the feedback.  made the changes according to the feedback",
